URL: https://gfcafe.preview.resto.cloud/admin/stock-manager#out-of-stock
Path: Sidebar -> Catalog -> Stock Manager -> "Нет в наличии" tab
Description: Shows all items that are currently out of stock. A celebratory message is shown if everything is in stock.

Annotation:
- Red oval around the "Нет в наличии" tab.
- Red arrow above the selected tab with the label "Стоп-лист".
